==Battleground==
*1 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Belial (Enemy)|Belial]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*3 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn after 63.33 seconds<sup>1,900f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn after 143.33 seconds<sup>4,300f</sup>, delay 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Happy 100 (Enemy)|Happy 100s]] spawn after 186.67 seconds<sup>5,600f</sup>, delay 50~66.67 seconds<sup>1,500f~2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Quite an easy stage even in {{3c}}, as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Classification#Rusher|Rushers]] such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] work well here.

